Spec: Assets

Purpose:
  Bundled map styles, app icon and activity icons.

Owns:
  ./map/retrail_light.json
  ./map/retrail_dark.json
  ./branding
  ./icons
  ./audio/countdown

References:
  /tool/tool.sdd
  /docs/specs/history/design-tokens.md

Must:
  The map styles are generated by `/tool/build_map_styles.dart`; colours change there, never in the JSON.
  The countdown clips are generated by `/tool/generate_countdown_clips.sh` with a paid Azure Speech tier
    (S0), never the free tier; the source and licence are in `audio/countdown/README.md`.
